{:id :csrf-get,
 :kind :diff-local,
 :what
 "A note is deleted by a GET as well as a POST, and the delete is a link: the anti-forgery check never looks at a GET, so a link or an image on any site deletes a logged-in user's note.",
 :edits
 [{:file "src/notes/routes.clj",
   :find "[\"/:id/delete\" {:post {:handler web/delete-note!}}]]",
   :replace
   "[\"/:id/delete\" {:get {:handler web/delete-note!}\n                    :post {:handler web/delete-note!}}]]"}
  {:file "src/notes/web.clj",
   :find
   "(form (str \"/notes/\" (:id n) \"/delete\") [:button {:type \"submit\"} \"Delete\"])",
   :replace
   "[:a {:href (str \"/notes/\" (:id n) \"/delete\")} \"Delete\"]"}],
 :reference "a-note-is-deleted-only-by-a-post-with-its-token"}
